Subject: [PATCH] win32u: FlashWindowEx timers

FlashWindowEx with FLASHW_TIMER, FLASHW_TIMERNOFG or a count above one flashes
the caption on a window timer and stops as documented. CORE: integrator must
review (patches/notes/5215.txt).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XZFS4SPPzeH5d2c1MuzqCS
